WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.468
-Guys, as you know, every week,

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:03.836
we like to bring you some
uplifting, creative videos,

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.671
whether they come from
quarantine

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:06.906
or just stuff
around the country.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.609
So it's time for
"What Are You Doing Wednesday."

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:12.512
-♪ What are you doing
on Wednesday? ♪

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:15.247
♪ What are you
doing on Wednesday? ♪

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:19.685
-First up, this French bulldog
makes some pretty strange sounds

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:20.954
when he gets excited.

00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:21.988
Take a look.

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:26.392
[ Dog screaming ]

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:28.395
-Oh, yeah? No. No.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:33.700
[ Screaming continues ]

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.702
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:39.772
-Uh, sir, there's something
wrong with your baby.

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:41.540
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.310
Next up, it seems like this kid
has been overhearing

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.246
a lot of work calls
in quarantine,

00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:49.548
because this is what he does
when his parents' phone rings.

00:00:49.548 --> 00:00:53.520
[ Cellphone ringing ]

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.521
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:56.989
[ Claps hands ]

00:00:56.989 --> 00:00:59.492
[ Laughter continues ]

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:01.294
♪♪

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.295
He's so cute.

00:01:03.295 --> 00:01:04.764
[ Laughs ]

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:08.200
"When I was your age, we used to
dance to the dial-up tone.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.304
Here comes the thunder."

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:14.873
[ Punch lands! ]

00:01:14.873 --> 00:01:16.909
"You broke my other arm."

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:18.544
Next up, this woman's husband

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:21.313
wanted her to cut back
on her spending in quarantine.

00:01:21.313 --> 00:01:23.883
And she found a pretty great way
to get him back.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:31.557 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:31.557 --> 00:01:38.965 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:41.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.369
Tiny egg! Tiny egg!

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:47.340
And finally, this guy's
social-distance birthday party

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.342
got ruined by a confetti cannon.

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:50.343
Take a look.

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:52.712
-Yes.

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:56.515
-[Bleep] Ah!

00:01:56.515 --> 00:01:58.051
Oh!

00:01:58.051 --> 00:02:00.220
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:07.193
There you go, everybody.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:09.162
That is "What Are You Doing
Wednesdays."

